  id: movement
  title: Movement
  body: "<b>WASD</b> move   \u2022   <b>Shift</b> sprint   \u2022   <b>C</b> crouch
    (toggle)\n\nWalk into a wall to press your back against it. While hugging a wall,
    move the mouse to peek left or right.\n\nPress <b>E</b> to interact: pick up
    items, open doors, climb ladders."
